---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="about - yuga" showFooterRedirect={true}>
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4">
        <Header />
        <main class="py-8">
            <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-8">About</h1>
            <p class="mb-4">
                I am an 18-year-old developer currently studying CS at <a
                    href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jain_University"
                    class="text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline"
                    >Jain University</a
                >. I'm currently still figuring out what excites me :P
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4">
                I enjoy consuming all forms of art/media and my entire
                personality surrounds around it,
                I am a big weeb/otaku lol &gt;w&lt;
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4">
                When i was a kid i was always fascinated by computers and
                tinkered with them. I had a very old laptop with only 2gb ram
                (currently my home server lol) and i was always trying to get
                the most out of it and i even had a windows xp office computer
                with which i played around alot and they made me love computers.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4">
                I'm new to making <a
                    href="/blog"
                    class="text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline">blogs</a
                > and i hope people enjoy reading them :D and also check out my <a
                    href="/projects"
                    class="text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline">projects</a
                > if you are interested.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4">
                I watch too much anime and manhwa, i keep track of them at my <a href="https://anilist.co/user/bys/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline"><img src="/icons/AniList_logo.svg" alt="" class="inline-block h-[1.1em] w-auto align-[-0.15em] mr-1" />anilist</a>.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4">
                I recently started watching more movies too, here is my <a href="https://letterboxd.com/bys_exe/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline"><img src="/icons/letterboxd-logo.svg" alt="" class="inline-block h-[1.1em] w-auto align-[-0.15em] mr-1" />letterboxd</a>.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4">
                I listen to a lot of Japanese music, and my <a href="https://www.last.fm/user/bys_exe" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline"><img src="/icons/lastfm-logo.png" alt="" class="inline-block h-[1.1em] w-auto align-[-0.15em] mr-1" />lastfm</a> just proves it even more lol :p
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4">
                also cant forget that i play games and my <a href="https://backloggd.com/u/bys/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline"><img src="/icons/backloggd-logo.jpg" alt="" class="inline-block h-[1.1em] w-auto align-[-0.15em] mr-1" />backloggd</a> keeps track of them
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4">
                LAST BUT NOT THE LEAST ADO IS MY QUEEN AND I WILL DO ANYTHING IF I CAN GO TO HER CONCERT ATLEAST ONCE IN MY LIFE <3
            </p>
        </main>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
